  "description": "A system of prejudice and discrimination against women, often manifesting as the belief that women are inferior to men in intelligence, competence, or emotional stability. The 'karen' stereotype is rooted in misogynistic assumptions that women are overly emotional, entitled, or irrational — particularly when they assert themselves in public or professional spaces. This meme relies on such stereotypes to mock and demean its target.",
